# Keep shell scripts LF-normalized.
#
# A CRLF line ending turns the shebang into "#!/bin/bash\r", which the kernel
# cannot resolve, so Linux builds (Netlify, VPS) fail the moment the script is
# executed: "./netlify-build.sh: cannot execute: required file not found".
# Force LF on checkout so a Windows editor can never re-introduce it.
*.sh text eol=lf